{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/verifier/1/skills/omem-evidence-review/SKILL.md",
    "title": "证据独立复核流程与判定边界",
    "summary": "说明独立复核角色如何先确认固定证据的有效性，再比较证据与提案的语义范围、辨别陈述主体、处理冲突与图像推断，并严格停留在评估而非批准或执行阶段。",
    "category": "workflow",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "purpose",
        "title": "解决什么问题",
        "body": "这套流程用于独立判断：固定的原始证据是否足以支持某项记忆或任务提案。复核者接收候选项与原始证据，产出结构化评估，但不负责批准变更。这样可以把“证据是否成立”和“是否应用变更”分成两个阶段，避免审查角色越权。参考 [[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "review-flow",
        "title": "从证据身份到语义支持",
        "body": "复核首先确认精确引文或图片身份；确定性校验无效或存在歧义时，结论不能标为支持。之后逐项比较证据与提案的主体、范围、时间、条件、否定关系、归属和断言强度，而不能只凭措辞相似作判断。参考 [[c2]]\n\n还需区分资料所有者的明确承诺、转述内容、建议以及未知主体的说法。若当前记忆中存在矛盾或后续更正，应保留冲突，而不是选择语气更自信的一方。参考 [[c3]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "limits",
        "title": "推断限制与输出边界",
        "body": "OCR 结果和图片描述默认属于推断，除非提供的图片本身能够被独立辨认；一次工具步骤成功也不能推出整体任务成功，更不能把相关性写成因果关系。复核结果只能以 `AssessmentBatch.v1` JSON 返回，角色不得批准、应用或执行变更，也不得发送消息或修改策略。参考 [[c4]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "独立证据复核职责",
        "reason": "说明该角色面向固定证据与候选提案执行独立验证，并只返回评估结果而不批准变更。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/verifier/1/skills/omem-evidence-review/SKILL.md",
          "startLine": 2,
          "endLine": 3
        },
        "quote": "name: omem-evidence-review\ndescription: Verify whether fixed omem evidence supports scoped memory or task proposals. Use for independent verifier jobs that receive candidates plus original evidence and must return AssessmentBatch.v1 without approving changes."
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "证据与提案核对要点",
        "reason": "支持先校验引文或图片身份，再比较主体、范围、时间、条件及断言强度的复核顺序。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/verifier/1/skills/omem-evidence-review/SKILL.md",
          "startLine": 8,
          "endLine": 9
        },
        "quote": "1. Recheck exact quote or image identity before semantic review. An invalid or ambiguous deterministic check cannot become `supported`.\n2. Compare subject, scope, time, conditions, negation, attribution, and intended strength between evidence and proposal."
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "主体辨别与冲突保留",
        "reason": "支持区分承诺、转述、建议和未知主体，并在出现矛盾或后续更正时保留冲突。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/verifier/1/skills/omem-evidence-review/SKILL.md",
          "startLine": 10,
          "endLine": 11
        },
        "quote": "3. Distinguish owner commitments from forwarded speech, suggestions, and statements by unknown actors.\n4. Check supplied current memories for contradictions and later corrections. Preserve conflicts rather than selecting by confidence of wording."
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "推断与执行边界",
        "reason": "说明图像和 OCR 的推断属性、禁止过度归因，以及复核角色仅输出评估 JSON 的行为边界。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/verifier/1/skills/omem-evidence-review/SKILL.md",
          "startLine": 12,
          "endLine": 14
        },
        "quote": "5. Treat OCR and image descriptions as inferred unless the supplied image is independently readable.\n6. Do not infer overall success from a successful tool step or correlation from causation.\n7. Return AssessmentBatch.v1 JSON only. Never approve, apply, execute, message, or change policy."
      }
    ],
